{
  "title": "Quietly Braised Ukrainian Tomato Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Ukrainian stew made with tinned tomatoes and braised to perfection, featuring a buttery and shaggy texture, this dish is perfect for a festive occasion and is ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly.",
