  "instructions": [
    "Melt the butter in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to caramelize.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add the crushed tinned tomatoes, vegetable broth, carrots, potatoes, salt, and black pepper to the pot.",
    "Stir to combine, then bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pot, and simmer for 30 minutes or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
